","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"1_5TInJdy44V0Gez1kxP6Q","review_id":"TqnoEvLyVGFzCjPK7bxY2Q","date":"2020-11-23T18:07:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9099259376525879,"text_excerpt":"I watched with anticipation as The Simple Greek was being built and then right when they opened, COVID happened. I finally got the opportunity to try and it did not disappoint! It's a build your own bowl or wrap type of place and what I appreciate is that despite being slow because of COVID they still had 4 workers. I got a bowl and they do not skimp on any of the toppings. The garlic green beans were delicious and the spicy feta had just the right amount of flavor. They also stock a wide variety of bubly flavors, I got mango my fav. My entire bill was $12 so super reasonable. My only regret was it getting a baklava dessert!"},{"business_id":"1_5TInJdy44V0Gez1kxP6Q","review_id":"kP2tfBmAh7LMoNgl9ySnSQ","date":"2020-08-25T23:24:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8950670957565308,"text_excerpt":"WOWWWW this place is absolutely amazing. I haven't been to the location as I ordered through doordash but my food was the bomb. I ordered the BYO bowl & a soup. The bowl was totally enough for 2 servings and the falafel was so soft and delicious. All the toppings and sauces were so fresh too. The soup was sadly out of stock but I Instead got hummus and pita and it was a blessing in disguise because that was the best hummus and pita I've ever had. This is my new go to spot!"},{"business_id":"1_5TInJdy44V0Gez1kxP6Q","review_id":"XhGXj3XCerhOp0JIT2cz8w","date":"2020-07-03T01:58:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8115045428276062,"text_excerpt":"Better known for the initial franchises appearance on the CNBC show, the prophet, this restaurant is a welcome addition to the CBD"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
